{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2020-08", "window": 4, "start_date": 1598227200, "end_date": 1598918399, "month_true_total": 1605, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:47:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "75245519", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001290245", "personaname": "Arctos", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ArctosMajor/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 2850, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 428, "last_played": 1639265417, "avatar": "3f4f782abcfa0eff9a1035f777670b389be11e17"}, "language": "english", "review": "Even if you only have a passing familiarity with first person shooters, this game can still work for you. Even at the early stages of early access, I've had plenty of fun with it. I anticipate playing it a lot more with friends, and the combined roguelike and coop aspect is probably the greatest draw.", "timestamp_created": 1598916081, "timestamp_updated": 1598916081, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.550172984600067139", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75245514", "author": {"steamid": "76561198015840921", "personaname": "saus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/noobrage/", "num_games_owned": 1120, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 12924, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1878, "last_played": 1764906530, "avatar": "1c420d178f66d4691b32a82a49ec20a7825e74d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun Roguelite FPS. Uses a similar element system to Borderlands, but there's also a combination effect if you stack multiple. The guns are satisfying, and it's fun to try and shape a build. Extra fun when all your modifiers just click and support each other. Better with other people as you can drop modifiers to help shape each others builds in a run. There's a bit of long-term progression through unlocks and perks, at 30 hours I am only missing a couple guns and am almost max level.\n\nBiggest criticism is just how lite the content is. There is replay value, but there's only the three stages with no option to keep your run going once you clear the final boss. Actively being updated, which helps.", "timestamp_created": 1598916060, "timestamp_updated": 1598916060, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75243049", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000789138", "personaname": "Dancing", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198000789138/", "num_games_owned": 469, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1331, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 641, "last_played": 1783872758, "avatar": "cc65b2e51c12c364fdb62d61b2232e804b4c789a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like it.", "timestamp_created": 1598912235, "timestamp_updated": 1598912235, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75242097", "author": {"steamid": "76561198272708632", "personaname": "ladiesman217", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198272708632/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 4308, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 474, "last_played": 1788850696, "avatar": "e44931ac0f81f93af01fa7334070097e9dab08a8"}, "language": "english", "review": "game gud", "timestamp_created": 1598910688, "timestamp_updated": 1598910688, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75241277", "author": {"steamid": "76561198156281552", "personaname": "sun6000", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198156281552/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 10666, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3377, "last_played": 1780546692, "avatar": "ef653ea14be76b42c081735c7aaaacd65429f020"}, "language": "english", "review": "So, do you like borderlands 2 style of gunplay? Do you enjoy rogue likes? Are you the type of guy who is willing to endure getting their rear handed to them while you are still in the learning process? Do you like GUNS, and do you like chinese inspirations?\n\nThen this game is probably for you! While the game doesn't have much content right now in terms of levels, it makes it up a lot through replayability! With a ton of weapons you can play around with and unlock, 4 characters who can find their playstyle and perks varying from run to run via unique upgrades each one can get via golden goblets. Various scrolls to further add to your abilities, and a somewhat addicting permanent upgrade tree between runs.\n\nWhat Gunfire reborn does is simple, yet effective. Throwing you into linear levels, and giving you a hoard of enemies to shoot your way through.\n\nThat being said, there are some things you should be aware of. \n\nThis is a ROGUE LIKE, ya know, like games such as Binding of Isaac, Risk of Rain, or Gungeon. That means if you die, you go straight back to the very start. You have been warned people who aren't already invested in the genre.\n\nThe other thing about this game you must be wary of, is the rather steep learning curve at the start. Not helped by how the skill tree limits your power early on, meaning death can come really swiftly, and unexpectedly to those who aren't at their A game, especially at the very first boss who has an attack pattern that can be easily dodged, but is brutally punishing to those who haven't got a hang of it yet.\n\nBUT if you manage to break through the games punishing early learning curve, you have yourself a VERY fun, (and cheap) first person shooter on your hands! Even made better if you have a friend or two you can play with.\n\n(Note, you can only play multiplayer at lvl 10. If you wanna level up fast to unlock new characters and other things quickly. just buy lots of cheap upgrades, as each upgrade is a level)", "timestamp_created": 1598909223, "timestamp_updated": 1613016599, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75241251", "author": {"steamid": "76561198024193223", "personaname": "Kaneda", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DFNASTY/", "num_games_owned": 284, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 8865, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2360, "last_played": 1703158749, "avatar": "2f3052e62cb9ccf2236ae10c4337cb65f09e776b"}, "language": "english", "review": "cat is best", "timestamp_created": 1598909170, "timestamp_updated": 1598909170, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75240891", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084147394", "personaname": "[APOBTF] Aptomedia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198084147394/", "num_games_owned": 290, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 5603, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1558, "last_played": 1710834712, "avatar": "96b65d0306f434bbe7e3bb4feb711abc455591ea"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good multiplayer rogue action FPS, loved every 25 hours of it. The leveling system does make a noticeable difference for your progress in the game, love the higher difficulties and how it feels.", "timestamp_created": 1598908582, "timestamp_updated": 1598908582, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75239547", "author": {"steamid": "76561198138431514", "personaname": "76fortytwo", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198138431514/", "num_games_owned": 138, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 8067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1736, "last_played": 1784258706, "avatar": "9b75cb8641bec11676f66f3d8eb4995ddec08908"}, "language": "english", "review": "A+", "timestamp_created": 1598906440, "timestamp_updated": 1598906440, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "75239203", "auth